 "words": 160,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Eliphaz son of Esau had a firstborn son",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His name was Teman among the many listed there",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Omar Zepho Gatam and Kenaz followed him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chiefs descended from the mother Adah in the land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is there no longer wisdom in Teman",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Counsel has perished from the prudent",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their wisdom has decayed in the dust",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He founded a clan in the land of Edom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A chief among the people known by name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Husham ruled from the land of the Temanites",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the kings of Israel reigned upon the throne",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is there no longer wisdom in Teman",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Counsel has perished from the prudent",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their wisdom has decayed in the dust",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bozrah will become a horror and a disgrace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A ruin and a curse forevermore",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The pride of the heart has deceived the eagle",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who builds his nest as high as the sky",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave your orphans I will keep them alive",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
